{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39942","headline":"西寨寓居 二 · 徐夤","name":"西寨寓居 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"功智争驰澹薄空，犹怀忠信拟何从。\n鸱鸢啄腐疑雏凤，神鬼欺贫笑伯龙。\n烈日不融双鬓雪，病身全仰竹枝筇。\n崇侯入辅严陵退，堪忆啼猨万仞峯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39942.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39942","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}